    {
      "text": "Council staff report (March 3, 2026): two projects on one parcel by Sand Hill Property Company, owner Four Corners EPA Property Owner, LLC. Townhomes: 106 for-sale units, 11 affordable, 3 stories, 4.61 acres. Mixed-use: 168 rental units, 25 affordable, 6 stories, 5,555 sq ft retail, 1.45 acres. Both vested under SB 330 to the 2013 Ravenswood/4 Corners TOD Specific Plan; staff found both exempt from CEQA under Public Resources Code 21080.66 (AB 130).",
